# For `docker build -f apps/web/Dockerfile .` from the repository root (BuildKit reads this file
# next to the Dockerfile). Only apps/web, openapi and schema are sent; the rest is ignored.
*
!apps/web
!openapi
!schema
**/node_modules
**/build
**/.svelte-kit
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
